00:59:49.530 --> 00:59:51.780
<v Man>How's that working out for you?

00:59:51.780 --> 01:00:14.380
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

01:00:14.380 --> 01:00:19.380
